From: Tailscadble contributors
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] frameworks: add fail-closed Tailscadble policy

Keep one system-server policy owner for the listener. Require the system user,
boot completion, USB debugging, lifecycle observers, the active Tailscale VPN
package, a matching live VPN interface, and its CGNAT IPv4 address. Clear the
feature on user switches, USB disable, or ADB authorization revoke. Never log
the runtime address.

